  "citation": "VandenBygaart A J; Gregorich E G; Angers D A (2003): Influence of Agricultural Management on Soil Organic Carbon: A Compendium and Assessment of Canadian Studies. Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (USA). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/TCM.001",
